            <title>[KYLIN-5999] When querying beyond the model segment time range, it displays as a constant query.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5999</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Kylin4 Behavior: &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
When segment data is null and the model is hit, it prompts that the segment needs to be built. &#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Kylin5 Behavior: &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
Directly pushes down without hitting the model.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
